,"text":"Note that, if the user code will (possibly) match a string against a"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"multitude of patterns containing wildcards, chances are high that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"some patterns will require a reversed string. In this case, it’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"more efficient to provide the reversed string to avoid multiple","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"constructions thereof in the various calls to "},{"code":"g_pattern_match()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Note also that the reverse of a UTF-8 encoded string can in general"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"not be obtained by [func","type":"text"},{"code":"GLib.strreverse","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"]. This works only if the string","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"does not contain any multibyte characters. GLib offers the"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"[func"},{"code":"GLib.utf8_strreverse","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"] function to reverse UTF-8 encoded strings.","type":"text"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"pattern_match is deprecated:","type":"text"}]},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"Use [method@GLib.PatternSpec.match] instead"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib\/PatternSpec\/patternMatch(stringLength:string:stringReversed:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/glib\/patternspec\/patternmatch(stringlength:string:stringreversed:)"]}],"metadata":{"externalID":"s:4GLib19PatternSpecProtocolPAAE12patternMatch12stringLength0G00G8ReversedSbSi_SPys4Int8VGSgAKtF::SYNTHESIZED::s:4GLib11PatternSpecC","fragments":[{"t